UESDAY, MAY 11, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2021-05-07 06:00:00', 'title': 'CIGNA DELIVERS STRONG FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS, RAISES 2021 OUTLOOK', 'text': "BLOOMFIELD, CONN., MAY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TOTAL REVENUES IN THE FIRST QUARTER WERE $41.0 BILLION, AND ADJUSTED REVENUES1 WERE $41.0 BILLION SHAREHOLDERS' NET INCOME FOR THE FIRST QUARTER WAS $1.2 BILLION, OR $3.30 PER SHARE ADJUSTED INCOME FROM OPERATIONS2 FOR THE FIRST QUARTER WAS $1.7 BILLION, OR $4.73 PER SHARE ADJUSTED INCOME FROM OPERATIONS2,3 IS NOW PROJECTED TO BE AT LEAST $7.0 BILLION IN 2021, OR AT LEAST $20.20 PER SHARE3 GLOBAL HEALTH SERVICES COMPANY CIGNA CORPORATION (NYSE: CI) TODAY REPORTED STRONG FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS DRIVEN BY FOCUSED EXECUTION ACROSS ITS BUSINESSES."}{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2021-05-07 16:00:00', 'title': 'CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC. DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC. DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK'}{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2021-05-07 16:02:00', 'title': 'CSX CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA., MAY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) APPROVED A $0.28 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 31, 2021."}{'symbol': 'DVN', 'date': '2021-05-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'DEVON ENERGY ANNOUNCES VIRTUAL-ONLY FORMAT FOR 2021 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY, MAY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DEVON ENERGY CORP. (NYSE: DVN) TODAY ANNOUNCED A CHANGE IN THE LOCATION OF ITS 2021 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS. IN LIGHT OF CONTINUED CONCERNS REGARDING THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC, THE ANNUAL MEETING WILL BE HELD SOLELY BY REMOTE COMMUNICATION, IN A “VIRTUAL-ONLY” FORMAT. THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED DATE AND TIME OF THE MEETING (JUNE 9, 2021, AT 8:00 A.M. CENTRAL TIME) HAVE NOT CHANGED. THE DEVON ENERGY CENTER, INCLUDING THE DEVON ENERGY CENTER AUDITORIUM WHERE THE MEETING WAS TO OCCUR, WILL REMAIN CLOSED TO THE PUBLIC THROUGH THE TIME OF THE ANNUAL MEETING.'}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-05-07 16:19:00', 'title': 'DOVER DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., MAY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.495 (FORTY-NINE AND ONE-HALF CENTS) PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 28, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2021-05-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'DOW ADVANCES TO #19 ON 2021 TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LIST', 'text': "MIDLAND, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DOW (NYSE: DOW) ADVANCED TO THE 19TH PLACE ON THE 2021 DIVERSITYINC TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LIST, WHICH WAS ANNOUNCED YESTERDAY AT A VIRTUAL EVENT HOSTED BY DIVERSITYINC. DOW'S PLACEMENT ON THE LIST FOR THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR SHOWCASES THE COMPANY'S CONTINUED ACCELERATION OF ACTIONS AND STRENGTHENING OF INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY (I&D) ACROSS THE ORGANIZATION. DOW WAS ALSO INCLUDED ON 3 OF DIVERSITYINC'S SPECIALTY LISTS: 2ND ON TOP COMPANIES FOR EMP"}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-05-07 09:20:00', 'title': 'DTE ENERGY ANNOUNCES BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR DT MIDSTREAM', 'text': 'BOARD COMPRISED OF HIGHLY QUALIFIED, DIVERSE DIRECTORS WITH EXPERIENCE AND EXPERTISE TO OVERSEE THE NEW INDEPENDENT MIDSTREAM COMPANY'}{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2021-05-07 11:34:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB NAMED A TOP 50 COMPANY FOR DIVERSITY', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN., MAY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ECOLAB INC., THE GLOBAL LEADER IN WATER, HYGIENE AND INFECTION PREVENTION SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES, HAS AGAIN BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A TOP COMPANY FOR DIVERSITY BY DIVERSITYINC, A LEADING DIVERSITY PUBLICATION. ECOLAB RANKS 34TH ON THE 2021 LIST, WHICH IS THE MOST PROMINENT ASSESSMENT OF DIVERSITY MANAGEMENT IN CORPORATE AMERICA.'}{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2021-05-07 16:58:00', '